# Paid product masters + their generator. This repo is PUBLIC, so the purchasable
# PDFs and the script that embeds their full text must never be committed. They
# live only locally and in the private `guide-files` Netlify Blobs store, and the
# site 404s /private/* as a second layer. Mirrors purplelink's kits-delivery/.
private/

# Local tool artifacts, not part of the site build.
# hook.cache.json is the impeccable design-hook cache and rewrites itself on
# every edit; deno.lock is generated by the Netlify CLI. Both are pure noise.
.impeccable/
deno.lock
